  "content": {
    "title": "长春大学2020届毕业生“温暖校园”网络视频双选会圆满召开",
    "source": "长春大学",
    "publishDate": "2020-03-05",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\nline-height:26.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为进一步贯彻落实党中央、国务院关于促进高校毕业生就业工作的决策部署，减少疫情对毕业生就业工作的影响，为毕业生和用人单位搭建更便捷的交流平台，增强毕业生求职和用人单位招聘的有效性和针对性，促进我校毕业生更充分和更高质量就业。长春大学于</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日与慧就业平台合作成功举办</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\">2020</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">届毕业生“温暖校园”网络视频双选会。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\nline-height:26.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次网络双选会吸引了浙江、上海、广东、北京、江苏、吉林等全国各地共</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">135</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家优质单位参与招聘揽才，涵盖制造业、电子、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">IT</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、教育、批发零售、新兴产业等行业，共提供了职位数</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">11755</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1701</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">名毕业生参会，学生投递简历</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2876</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份，有效视频面试</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">72</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">场，即时沟通</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6573</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">次，有效会话</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">32865</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">条。保证了毕业生求职和单位用人需求。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\nline-height:26.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">此次双选会为毕业生和用人单位提供了全环节、全要素的就业功能体验，为毕业生顺利就业提供保障。各学院精心组织毕业生，做到一对一沟通联系，指导、鼓励未就业毕业生踊跃参加双选会。经了解，学生们对学校举办的线上双选会表示高度赞赏，特殊时期举办了特别的网络双选会，解决了未就业毕业生找工作的烦恼。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p>\n\n\n<!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n <w:WordDocument>\n  <w:View>Normal</w:View>\n  <w:Zoom>0</w:Zoom>\n  <w:TrackMoves/>\n  <w:TrackFormatting/>\n  <w:PunctuationKerning/>\n  <w:DrawingGridVerticalSpacing>7.8 磅</w:DrawingGridVerticalSpacing>\n  <w:DisplayHorizontalDrawingGridEvery>0</w:DisplayHorizontalDrawingGridEvery>\n  <w:DisplayVerticalDrawingGridEvery>2</w:DisplayVerticalDrawingGridEvery>\n  <w:ValidateAgainstSchemas/>\n  <w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>false</w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>\n  <w:IgnoreMixedContent>false</w:IgnoreMixedContent>\n  <w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>false</w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>\n  <w:DoNotPromoteQF/>\n  <w:LidThemeOther>EN-US</w:LidThemeOther>\n  <w:LidThemeAsian>ZH-CN</w:LidThemeAsian>\n  <w:LidThemeComplexScript>X-NONE</w:LidThemeComplexScript>\n  <w:Compatibility>\n   <w:SpaceForUL/>\n   <w:BalanceSingleByteDoubleByteWidth/>\n   <w:DoNotLeaveBackslashAlone/>\n   <w:ULTrailSpace/>\n   <w:DoNotExpandShiftReturn/>\n   <w:AdjustLineHeightInTable/>\n   <w:BreakWrappedTables/>\n   <w:SnapToGridInCell/>\n   <w:WrapTextWithPunct/>\n   <w:UseAsianBreakRules/>\n   <w:DontGrowAutofit/>\n   <w:SplitPgBreakAndParaMark/>\n   <w:EnableOpenTypeKerning/>\n   <w:DontFlipMirrorIndents/>\n   <w:OverrideTableStyleHps/>\n   <w:UseFELayout/>\n  </w:Compatibility>\n  <w:DoNotOptimizeForBrowser/>\n  <m:mathPr>\n   <m:mathFont m:val=\"Cambria Math\"/>\n   <m:brkBin m:val=\"before\"/>\n   <m:brkBinSub m:val=\"&#45;-\"/>\n   <m:smallFrac m:val=\"off\"/>\n   <m:dispDef/>\n   <m:lMargin m:val=\"0\"/>\n   <m:rMargin m:val=\"0\"/>\n   <m:defJc m:val=\"centerGroup\"/>\n   <m:wrapIndent m:val=\"1440\"/>\n   <m:intLim m:val=\"subSup\"/>\n   <m:naryLim m:val=\"undOvr\"/>\n  </m:mathPr></w:WordDocument>\n</xml><![endif]--><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n <w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\" DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"false\"\n  DefSemiHidden=\"false\" DefQFormat=\"false\" DefPriority=\"99\"\n  LatentStyleCount=\"376\">\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\